<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Report: July 19 - July 26, 2026</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700&family=Rajdhani:wght@400;600&display=swap');

        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0f1015;
            --accent-purple: #b829ea;
            --accent-blue: #2974ea;
            --panel-bg: rgba(20, 22, 30, 0.85);
            --text-light: #e0e2e8;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(184, 41, 234, 0.05), rgba(41, 116, 234, 0.05));
            font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .header-nav {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn-back {
            padding: 10px 24px;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--accent-purple);
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-purple);
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(184, 41, 234, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            background: var(--accent-purple);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(184, 41, 234, 0.5);
        }

        .content-panel {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            background: var(--panel-bg);
            border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #fff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .data-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .data-item {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-purple);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .data-item:hover {
            transform: translateX(8px);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        }

        .data-label {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header-nav">
        <!-- Relative link taking you back to the main hub -->
        <a href="index.html" class="btn-back">← RETURN TO HUB</a>
        <div style="font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">SECURE CONNECTION</div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-panel">
        <h1>REPORT: JULY 19 - JULY 26, 2026</h1>
        
        <ul class="data-list">
            <li class="data-item">
                <span class="data-label">TICKETS RESOLVED</span>
                Successfully closed 42 pending reports from the main queue during this timeframe.
            </li>
            <li class="data-item">
                <span class="data-label">SYSTEM STATUS</span>
                All servers operating at 99.9% uptime throughout the week.
            </li>
            <li class="data-item">
                <span class="data-label">NOTES</span>
                Data collection finalized for the week of July 19th. No critical errors detected.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
